        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file for starting an OAuth or OIDC authorization-code login, I will use Google's OAuth 2.0 service as the concrete external provider. I will import the necessary modules from the Google API client library, which will make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
